cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release below."
title: "pifira: Pressure-based inverse fire analysis with evidence-gated LH2 utilities"
abstract: >-
  A data-agnostic Python toolkit for pressure-based inverse fire heat analysis
  of pressurized tanks, supplemented by evidence-gated liquid-hydrogen
  ortho-para thermodynamics, state-point and pathwise composition screens,
  published natural-conversion kinetics, and fixed-nozzle comparators. No
  experimental or validation data are bundled.
type: software
authors:
